      "raw": "<p>S, Discord is a chat program focused on gamers. you would need to sign up and create a server.</p><p>https://discordapp.com/</p><p>Briar made a rolling bot for discord.<br />https://github.com/darthdie/gmnitron/commit/10939dd129ad91995532df5bebe5679c12758273</p><p><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">and&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">https://roll20.net/</span></p><p>Someone on the forums made a Charater sheet for it. you need to log on and make the game. This is his thread on the topic, might not be&nbsp;bad to&nbsp;invite them.</p><p>https://greaterthangames.com/forum/topic/roll20-character-sheets-11219</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;, HelveticaNeue, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14.4px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">As for me I can play or sit out. We will see what happens</span><br />&nbsp;</p>",
